---
const quotes = [
  {
    quote: 'People stopped asking for the menu and just ordered from the site. The phone still rings, but now half the orders show up by themselves.',
    name: 'Restaurant owner',
    role: 'Rockville',
    result: 'Orders started coming in within the first week',
  },
  {
    quote: 'The pictures and the price list do the selling for us. Customers bring the car in because the site already told them what it costs and how long it takes.',
    name: 'Auto shop owner',
    role: 'Gaithersburg',
    result: 'More booked inspections and fewer phone tag questions',
  },
  {
    quote: 'The table on the site fills up on weekends. We put the reservation link at the top and people started using it right away, especially on their phone.',
    name: 'Café owner',
    role: 'Montgomery County',
    result: 'Reservations that book themselves on weekends',
  },
];
---

<section class="section section--paper container" id="results">
  <div class="section-head reveal">
    <h2>What happens after the site goes live</h2>
    <p>Customers start discovering from their phone and ordering is the obvious next step. These are the kinds of results owners see once the site stops being quiet: new orders, new bookings, and fewer missed calls.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="results">
    {quotes.map((q, i) => (
      <figure class="result reveal" style={`transition-delay: ${i * 80}ms`}>
        <blockquote>"{q.quote}"</blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          <b>{q.name}</b>
          <span>{q.role}</span>
        </figcaption>
        <div class="result__outcome">
          <span aria-hidden="true">▲</span> {q.accent}
        </div>
      </figure>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .results { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
  .result {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;
    background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--r-md);
    padding: 28px 26px 24px; margin: 0; box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }
  .result:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
  blockquote { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink); flex: 1; }
  blockquote::first-letter { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
  figcaption { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
  figcaption b { font-size: 0.95rem; }
  figcaption span { color: var(--ink-3); font-size: 0.84rem; }
  .result__outcome {
    margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line-2);
    color: var(--accent-deep); font-size: 0.88rem; font-weight: 620;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .results { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>